data: {"id": "7a95bb906d9a452f-thinking-parallel_evidence-1676", "run_id": "7a95bb906d9a452f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **实体身份与生命周期**\n   - Pod `aiops-case-11/workload` 仍然存在（未被 Kubernetes 垃圾回收）。\n   - Pod UID：`98974b5c-1ddf-4f28-83ab-c916c5fb975d`，IP：`172.16.104.21`，调度在 `node2`。\n   - 容器 `app`：`State=Terminated`，Exit Code=137，Started `03:47:04`，Finished `03:47:18`（仅存活 14 秒），Restart Count=0。\n   - 容器当前 ready=False，Pod phase=Running（但 metadata.status.phase 与外部 `kubectl get` 看到的 STATUS=Terminating 一致，因为 deletion 流程已启动）。\n\n2. **Terminating 直接原因证据**\n   - `deletionTimestamp: 2026-09-11T03:47:07Z`，距当前已超过 **97 分钟", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789104271804, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

